Analog Canvas user-authored Verilog-A model qualification

ground 0
load "icm_conductance.osdi"
model conductance icm_conductance
model voltage vsource

V1 (input 0) voltage dc=2.5
G1 (input 0) conductance g=2m

control
  abort always
  options rawfile="ascii" strictsave=2 reltol=1e-8 vntol=1e-10
  save default
  analysis custom_op op
endc
